{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16141","headline":"故梁国公主池亭 · 王建","name":"故梁国公主池亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平阳池馆枕秦川，门锁南山一朵烟。\n素柰花开西子面，绿榆枝散沈郎钱。\n装檐玳瑁随风落，傍岸鵁鶄逐暖眠。\n寂寞空余歌舞地，玉箫声绝凤归天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16141.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16141","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}